;====================<WINQUOTES>====================
[Quotes]



;====================<IORI WINQUOTES>====================
victory0 = "Remember me when you look at the moon!"
victory1 = "Swatting flies ain't my thing. Buzz off."
victory2 = "Bwahaha! You should have seen yourself dance and fall into the flames!"
victory3 = "No encores. You're not worth my time."
victory4 = "Trash should do what trash does best: rot away."
victory5 = "Feel the despair of dying, and the absolute terror I bring!"
victory6 = "If you don't want to be turned to cinders, get out of my sight and stay there!"
victory7 = "Congratulations! You've mastered being an idiot. Now stop wasting my time."
victory8 = "You should take heart. I bet the flames of Hell burn hotter than mine."
victory9 = "Quit gasping like that. If you value your life, get lost."
victory10 = "Idiot... You thought you could fight me and go home in one piece?!"
victory11 = "If you hadn't resisted, I would have sent you to your grave peacefully."
victory12 = "Dance in a fiery shourd, until the hands of Death claim you."

;Iori Yagami
victory13 = "You... who the hell are you? You dare try and fool me with this mimicry?!"
victory14 = "I'll rip off that phony hide of yours!"
victory15 = "You're only a fake... This is a waste of time."
victory16 = "I hope you enjoy your view from the mud. You'll never reach that crescent moon!"
victory17 = "How utterly worthless... Do you think I can be beaten by a mere mirror image of myself!?"

;Orochi Iori
victory18 = "... You think this is enough to torment me? You underestimate me!"

;Kyo Kusanagi
victory19 = "No more trying to reason with me, Kyo! Your life ends here!"
victory20 = "Get up, Kyo. I won't let you die this easily. I will keep bashing you until my blood runs cold."
victory21 = "You don't know your fate? How about hell on earth?!"
victory22 = "What's the matter, Kyo?! You call that fighting?!"
victory23 = "Kyo, I will burn anything and everything to extinguish your existence."

;Mature
victory24 = "Begone! If you're of no use to me, then your existence is worthless!"

;Vice
victory25 = "I knew you'd show up eventually. Stop following me, or I won't hesitate to kill you!"

;Ash Crimson
victory26 = "That smile on your face... I can't resist setting it on fire."

;Chizuru Kagura
victory27 = "You never shut up, do you?! Who gave you the right to preach to me about my fate?"

;Chris
victory28 = "You're a little fly buzzing around my face. Go join Orochi already!"

;Shermie
victory29 = "If you want to touch me, go ahead. Feel the fire scorch your skin!"

;Yashiro Nanakase
victory30 = "I couldn't give a rat's ass about your grudges and your beliefs. Just die again already!"

;Andy Bogard
victory31 = "I won't harass a loser who's lost his fangs. Be gone now, and take your humiliation with you!"

;Athena Asamiya
victory32 = "Don't delude yourself. You can't change people, and you can't change the world!"

;Balrog (Boxer)
victory33 = "What do you think? How did it feel to taste the fires of Hell firsthand?!"

;Benimaru Nikaido
victory34 = "Rivals...? What nonsense! I will kill Kyo, and I won't let you stand in my way!"

;Billy Kane
victory35 = "Try as many times as you want, the results won't change. Leave while you can still move."

;Blanka
victory36 = "No matter what I say, a beast like you is incapable of understanding. But I dare say die!"

;Cammy White
victory37 = "Nothing more than a fragile doll. One twist and the screams cease...!"

;Chang Koehan
victory38 = "What happens to those who fear the flames? Livestock is destined to be burned!" 

;Chun-Li
victory39 = "No one has the right to judge me. Not even God himself!"

;Clark Still
victory40 = "Your hand-to-hand combat is like child's play to me. You'd better stay down if you don't want to get killed."

;Dan Hibiki
victory41 = "... Noisy fly! Don't you dare pester me ever again!"

;Goro Daimon
victory42 = "There's no place for sportsmen here! Run while you're still alive!"

;Dhalsim
victory43 = "I'm not here to listen to your street corner preaching, holy man!"

;E. Honda
victory44 = "From this day forth, your face will be forever scarred with an inextinguishable fear!"

;Eagle
victory45 = "You, what are you... Don't give me that dirty look!"

;Elisabeth Blanctorche
victory46 = "I don't care about your destiny... If you bother me again, that will be the last time."

;Geese Howard
victory47 = "Still alive? Your suffering will continue in the afterlife, loser!"

;Gouki
victory48 = "Go ahead and kill me if you can! At this rate, I needn't hold back!"

;Guile
victory49 = "Leave my sight! You military types are among those I hate most!"

;Haohmaru
victory50 = "We don't get to choose how we die. So here and now, breathe your last regrets!"

;Hibiki Takane
victory51 = "You are the one to be cut down! I will burn fear into those vacant eyes of yours!"

;Joe Higashi
victory52 = "I've had enough of you... Do want me to burn you to ash?!"

;K'
victory53 = "I have no use for a fake like you... Don't show your face in front of me again!"

;Ken Masters
victory54 = "If you're so desperate to burn, I'll gladly burn you to your bones!" 

;Sie Kensou
victory55 = "I'm sick of seeing the fear in your face. Get lost, you little brat!"

;Kim Kaphwan
victory56 = "Such a superficial idea of justice... You sicken me!" 

;King
victory57 = "Your destiny was sealed the moment you crossed me!"

;Kula Diamond
victory58 = "I don't have time to play your games. Get out of here before I change my mind!"

;Kyosuke Kagami
victory59 = "At best, you maintained a calm façade. But you couldn't keep your confidence in the face of death!"

;Leona Heidern
victory60 = "Are you scared of the power of Orochi...? Then let me put you to sleep permanently!"

;M. Bison (Dictator)
victory61 = "My power's origins? I haven't the want or the need to tell you anything!"

;Mai Shiranui
victory62 = "I can't even sympathise with you. Burn away with no time for regrets!" 

;Maki Genryuusai
victory63 = "No need for confusion. You were always destined to die a miserable death!"

;Morrigan Aensland
victory64 = "Be it the Demon Realm or Hell itself, no flame burns hotter than the hatred in my blood!"

;Nakoruru
victory65 = "I spared you the burden of cremation. No need to thank me..."

;Raiden
victory66 = "This is no place for a showboating clown. Get out of my sight, now!"

;Ralf Jones
victory67 = "Pick one.. Die on the battlefield, or drown in an ocean of blood; whichever you want!"

;Red Arremer
victory68 = "The only monster I need... is the one who lives in me."

;Robert Garcia
victory69 = "This is Kyokugen...? Whatever... This is your limit."

;Rock Howard
victory70 = "You do not have the freedom to fight! Crawl out of here!"

;Rolento F. Schugerg
victory71 = "Your inane ramblings end here! I kill mad fanatics like you without question!"

;Rugal Bernstein
victory72 = "You'll remember me each time you look at the moon. Tremble before the blue Yagami flame!"

;Ryo Sakazaki
victory73 = "My techniques are not so weak you can withstand them with feigned endurance alone!"

;Ryu
victory74 = "A true fighter...? You're just another low life nothing spouting garbage!"

;Ryuhaku Todoh
victory75 = "'Fair and Square'... Just hearing it pisses me off. Never say it again!"

;Sagat
victory76 = "Even the fierce tiger flinches in the face of the flames. You're no better than an animal!"

;Sakura Kasugano
victory77 = "Stick your neck out just for the fun of it, and you'll only wind-up drowning in your own blood...!"

;Takuma Sakazaki
victory78 = "You risk your life for a farce. How stupid can you get?"

;Terry Bogard
victory79 = "Now do you see what I mean? You're no hero, you're nothing but scum!"

;Tessa (Tabasa)
victory80 = "Back off, girl nerd. Do you really want to die for your research? Do you?"

;Vanessa
victory81 = "Do you ever learn...? If you want to feel the same searing pain again, come see me anytime."

;Vega (Claw)
victory82 = "Now you find yourself made into a bloodied canvas!"

;Ryuji Yamazaki
victory83 = "Trash belongs in the dump. Wouldn't you agree? Worthless scum!"

;Yuri Sakazaki
victory84 = "I'll start by crushing your throat! That high-pitched squawking pierced my ears!"

;Zangief
victory85 = "No amount of training your body will save you from my flames!"



;====================<OROCHI IORI WINQUOTES>====================
victory86 = "Gaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa!!!"
victory87 = "I'll... kill... you...!"
victory88 = "Kishaaaaaaah!! Uugyaaaaah!!"
victory89 = "... U... u... u... u... u..."
victory90 = "... Kuuu... Huuuu!... Fuuu..."

;Kyo Kusanagi
victory91 = "Kill... Kusanagi... Kill... Kyo..."

;Hakkesshu
victory92 = "O... rochi..."



;====================<CLAW IORI WINQUOTES>====================
victory93 = "Bothersome pest! Get out of here! I have no business with you!"
victory94 = "Crawl into a corner and die! A perfect ending for someone like you!"
victory95 = "I've grown tired of your screams. It's about time you died."
victory96 = "You can't touch the moon... Grovel there forever!"
victory97 = "I won't finish you. Writhe in pain until madness consumes your mind!"

;Kyo Kusanagi
victory98 = "After I kill the kid, I'm coming for you. You'd better stay alive for me until then, Kyo!"

;Ash Crimson
victory99 = "You'll regret messing with me this far, far after you're in your grave!"